      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bigler%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When Bigler Township was erected, it drew 4,646 acres from Woodward, 4,064 from Beccaria, 2,332 from Knox, and 1,821 from Geulich.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
